WEBVTT

00:05:29.462 --> 00:05:34.359
such as Saudi Arabia, Iran and the worst
case, the Taliban in Afghanistan,

00:05:34.383 --> 00:05:36.983
they are pretty authoritarian --
no doubt about that.

00:05:37.007 --> 00:05:38.433
For example, in Saudi Arabia,

00:05:38.457 --> 00:05:40.976
there is a phenomenon
called the religious police.

00:05:41.000 --> 00:05:44.976
And the religious police imposes
the supposed Islamic way of life

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:47.109
on every citizen, by force --

00:05:47.133 --> 00:05:50.117
like, women are forced
to cover their heads --

00:05:50.141 --> 00:05:52.929
wear the hijab, the Islamic head cover.

00:05:53.859 --> 00:05:55.463
Now that is pretty authoritarian,

00:05:55.487 --> 00:05:57.769
and that's something
I'm very much critical of.

00:05:58.619 --> 00:06:02.205
But when I realized that the non-Muslim,